---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Help from me
eyebrow: Services
subtitle: If you'd rather have someone set things up for you, that's what this page is about.
permalink: /services/
---
<div class="lead" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);">
  Project Broadsheet is free. Most people run it themselves using the guides in the docs. If you'd rather not spend a weekend on it — or you want a hand moving an archive over, picking fonts, wiring up a newsletter, or changing something about how the site works — you can hire me by the hour to do it with you.
</div>

{% for svc in services %}
<section class="feature-block" id="{{ svc.slug }}">
  <div class="feature-block__grid">
    <header class="feature-block__header">
      <span class="eyebrow">{{ svc.name }}</span>
      <h2>{{ svc.name }}</h2>
      <p class="feature-block__summary">{{ svc.summary }}</p>
      <p class="feature-block__price"><strong>${{ pricing.hourly.price | replace("$","") }} per hour</strong></p>
      <div class="feature-block__cta">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ svc.cta.url }}">{{ svc.cta.label }}</a>
      </div>
    </header>
    <ul class="feature-block__list">
      {% for inc in svc.includes %}<li>{{ inc }}</li>{% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
{% endfor %}

<div class="callout" style="margin-top: var(--space-2xl);">
  <div class="callout__title">How this works</div>
  <p>Every project starts with a short conversation so you can tell me what you're after, and I can tell you roughly how long it'll take. If the work isn't a good fit for me, I'll say so and try to point you somewhere useful.</p>
  <p>Every email and reply comes from me, not a team. That sometimes means a day or two to respond, but you always know who you're talking to.</p>
</div>
